le-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#位置与条目","content":"位置与条目","locale":"zh"},"5298":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"`maxHistory`","locale":"zh"},"5299":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#reset","content":"`reset()`","locale":"zh"},"5300":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#rebase","content":"`rebase()`","locale":"zh"},"5301":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#创建新分支","content":"创建新分支","locale":"zh"},"5302":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#在不保留历史的情况下加载状态","content":"在不保留历史的情况下加载状态","locale":"zh"},"5303":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"安全地读取历史","locale":"zh"},"5304":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","content":"Travels 时间线中有两个相关但不同的概念：导航使用的**保留历史窗口**，以及 `reset()` 使用的**实例基线**。理解它们的生命周期，可以避免许多微妙的撤销/重做缺陷。","locale":"zh"},"5305":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#位置与条目","content":"位置 `0` 是当前保留窗口的起点。每个补丁条目代表一次通往下一位置的转换。如果保留了三个条目，就可以重建四个状态：窗口基线加上三次转换。","locale":"zh"},"5306":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#位置与条目","content":"最旧的转换已被裁剪，但当前状态仍然是 `5`，保留窗口从 `2` 开始。","locale":"zh"},"5307":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"`maxHistory` 必须是非负整数。小数、`NaN` 与 `Infinity` 等无效值会被立即拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"5308":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"它统计的是补丁条目，而不是状态数量。","locale":"zh"},"5309":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"旧条目会被自动丢弃。","locale":"zh"},"5310":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"位置相对于保留窗口，因此不会超过该上限。","locale":"zh"},"5311":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"`reset()` 仍然可以恢复最初的实例基线。","locale":"zh"},"5312":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"请有意设置上限；默认情况下，“无限”历史并不是安全的持久化策略。","locale":"zh"},"5313":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#maxhistory","content":"当应用需要诊断时，`onWarning` 可以报告 `HISTORY_TRIMMED`。不要仅通过比较每次操作前后的位置来推断是否溢出；导航与 `rebase()` 也会改变位置。","locale":"zh"},"5314":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#reset","content":"`reset()` 会恢复到实例创建或恢复时捕获的基线，然后把时间线清空回该基线。","locale":"zh"},"5315":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#reset","content":"对于恢复得到的实例，基线是恢复操作捕获的、经过校验的起始时间线。之后改变基线的操作——例如 `rebase()`、`replaceStateWithoutHistory()`，或在暂停跟踪期间的更新——会影响后续 `reset()` 返回到哪里。","locale":"zh"},"5316":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#rebase","content":"`rebase()` 会把当前状态设为新的初始基线，并丢弃所有保留的过去与未来条目。","locale":"zh"},"5317":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#rebase","content":"只有在旧时间线本就应该不可达时才使用 `rebase()`，例如接受服务器快照之后，或有意开始新的编辑会话时。它不等同于撤销到位置 `0`。","locale":"zh"},"5318":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#创建新分支","content":"调用 `back()` 之后，未来的条目仍可通过 `forward()` 访问，直到新的编辑被提交。那次编辑会丢弃重做分支，并在当前位置追加新条目。","locale":"zh"},"5319":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#创建新分支","content":"需要审计或清理时，使用 `onBranchDiscard({ position, discarded })`。该钩子在提交转换之后运行，无法否决它。","locale":"zh"},"5320":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#在不保留历史的情况下加载状态","content":"`replaceStateWithoutHistory(updater)` 会应用一次更新、清空历史，并把结果设为新基线。它适合接受权威的远程快照，或替换文档而不让用户撤销回之前的文档。","locale":"zh"},"5321":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#在不保留历史的情况下加载状态","content":"`pauseTracking()` 与 `resumeTracking()` 则定义一个作用域：其中的更新会成为新基线，而普通时间线操作在此之后继续。参见跟踪与替换。","locale":"zh"},"5322":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"`getHistory()` 返回共享的、带缓存的只读数组，其中是只读状态视图。在渲染或度量当前时间线时使用它。","locale":"zh"},"5323":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"`getHistorySnapshot()` 返回脱离原对象、由调用方拥有的状态。需要保留、排序、发送给 Worker 或修改结果时使用它。","locale":"zh"},"5324":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"`getPatches()` 返回脱离原对象的、保留的补丁快照。","locale":"zh"},"5325":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"`getControls().patches` 是带缓存的只读视图，在历史变化之前其身份保持稳定。","locale":"zh"},"5326":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/history-lifecycle#安全地读取历史","content":"可变时间线可能与历史条目共享活动对象，因此旧的 `getHistory()` 结果可能反映之后的原地更新。当历史值必须保持不变时，脱离原对象的快照才是正确的工具。","locale":"zh"},"5327":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"page","content":"Travels 如何工作","breadcrumbs":["Travels","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","locale":"zh"},"5328":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","content":"沿着一条时间线，理解状态、正向补丁、反向补丁、位置与分支。","locale":"zh"},"5329":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"五个核心术语","locale":"zh"},"5330":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#一次编辑两个方向","content":"一次编辑，两个方向","locale":"zh"},"5331":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#默认为不可变模式","content":"默认为不可变模式","locale":"zh"},"5332":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#面向引用稳定-store-的可变模式","content":"面向引用稳定 Store 的可变模式","locale":"zh"},"5333":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#自动归档与手动归档","content":"自动归档与手动归档","locale":"zh"},"5334":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#分支与重做边界","content":"分支与重做边界","locale":"zh"},"5335":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#保留窗口与真实基线","content":"保留窗口与真实基线","locale":"zh"},"5336":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"持久化保存了什么","locale":"zh"},"5337":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","content":"Travels 把每次有效更新转换为一次不可变状态转换，外加两组补丁：一组向前推进，另一组恢复之前的状态。这些转换按顺序保留下来，就构成了历史。","locale":"zh"},"5338":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"| 术语            | 含义             |\n| ------------- | -------------- |\n| **状态（State）** | 时间线当前位置上的应用数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5339":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"| 术语            | 含义                                |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **草稿（Draft）** | 传给 `setState()` 更新函数的、可直接修改的草稿对象。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5340":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"| 术语              | 含义                               |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **补丁（Patches）** | 描述一次转换的 JSON Patch 操作，以及它们的反向操作。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5341":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"| 术语               | 含义                      |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------- |\n| **位置（Position）** | 保留历史窗口中的游标；`0` 是该窗口的基线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5342":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#五个核心术语","content":"| 术语              | 含义                   |\n| --------------- | -------------------- |\n| **归档（Archive）** | 把待处理的更改提交为一个历史条目的动作。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5343":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#一次编辑两个方向","content":"考虑下面这个状态与更新：","locale":"zh"},"5344":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#一次编辑两个方向","content":"从概念上说，Travels 会保留这样一组正向条目：","locale":"zh"},"5345":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#一次编辑两个方向","content":"它还会保留把状态恢复为 `{ title: 'Draft', views: 0 }` 所需的反向条目。`back()` 应用反向操作；`forward()` 重新应用正向操作。使用 `setState()` 时，这两组补丁都不需要你手写。","locale":"zh"},"5346":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#一次编辑两个方向","content":"向后移动只会改变游标与状态；在下一次提交编辑创建分支之前，未来的条目不会被销毁。","locale":"zh"},"5347":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#默认为不可变模式","content":"在默认模式下，Travels 通过 Mutative 生成新的不可变状态。未发生变化的分支可以进行结构共享。请把 `getState()`、`getHistory()` 以及观察者事件返回的值视为只读：直接写入会绕过补丁记录，还可能修改补丁值所保留的对象。","locale":"zh"},"5348":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#默认为不可变模式","content":"在不可变模式下启用 `enableAutoFreeze: true`，可以让意外写入在开发阶段直接失败。如果需要由调用方拥有的历史数组，请使用 `getHistorySnapshot()`，不要修改共享的 `getHistory()` 缓存。","locale":"zh"},"5349":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#面向引用稳定-store-的可变模式","content":"设置 `mutable: true` 后，Travels 会把补丁直接应用回原对象，因此 MobX、Vue、Pinia 或自定义代理可以继续观察同一个引用。它仍然会为导航与持久化生成正向和反向补丁。","locale":"zh"},"5350":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#面向引用稳定-store-的可变模式","content":"根替换与原始类型根可能需要回退到不可变方式。`enableAutoFreeze` 不能与可变模式同时使用。可变模式指南解释了每种操作在对象身份上的行为。","locale":"zh"},"5351":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#自动归档与手动归档","content":"启用 `autoArchive: true` 时，每次有效的 `setState()` 都会创建一个条目。启用 `autoArchive: false` 时，状态更新会保持待处理，直到调用 `archive()`，或执行某个会隐式归档的操作。","locale":"zh"},"5352":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#自动归档与手动归档","content":"根级 `transaction()` 也会把多次更新合并在一起，但它还会对 Travels 观察者隐藏中间状态，并在失败时回滚由 Travels 跟踪的更改。","locale":"zh"},"5353":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#分支与重做边界","content":"`onBranchDiscard` 会收到这次转换所移除的条目。事务只报告根事务开始之前可见的重做条目，而不包括在临时工作中创建又完全丢弃的分支。","locale":"zh"},"5354":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#保留窗口与真实基线","content":"随着时间线向前推进，`maxHistory` 会丢弃旧补丁。游标相对于保留窗口，因此它的上限就是该限制。即使更早的条目已经被裁剪，`reset()` 仍然可以恢复实例的真实基线。","locale":"zh"},"5355":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#保留窗口与真实基线","content":"`rebase()` 不一样：它会主动丢弃全部过去与未来的历史，并把当前状态设为新基线。参见历史生命周期。","locale":"zh"},"5356":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"`serialize()` 会创建一个带版本的值，其中包含：","locale":"zh"},"5357":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"当前状态；","locale":"zh"},"5358":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"正向与反向补丁组；","locale":"zh"},"5359":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"当前位置；","locale":"zh"},"5360":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"可选的历史元数据；","locale":"zh"},"5361":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"Travels 历史模式版本。","locale":"zh"},"5362":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works#持久化保存了什么","content":"`Travels.deserialize()` 会校验这个值，`restoreTravels()` 会以原子方式从它重建时间线。不需要单独对齐状态与历史。","locale":"zh"},"5363":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"page","content":"状态要求","breadcrumbs":["Travels","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","locale":"zh"},"5364":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","content":"使用能够在重放与 JSON 持久化之后仍然正确的状态、补丁值、路径与元数据。","locale":"zh"},"5365":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#推荐的持久化数据","content":"推荐的持久化数据","locale":"zh"},"5366":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"兼容性矩阵","locale":"zh"},"5367":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#在边界处规范化集合","content":"在边界处规范化集合","locale":"zh"},"5368":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#不安全的路径键","content":"不安全的路径键","locale":"zh"},"5369":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#静态检查与运行时检查","content":"静态检查与运行时检查","locale":"zh"},"5370":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#用-createpatchabletravels-强制持久化形状","content":"用 `createPatchableTravels()` 强制持久化形状","locale":"zh"},"5371":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#直接检查一个值","content":"直接检查一个值","locale":"zh"},"5372":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#在序列化之前或期间校验","content":"在序列化之前或期间校验","locale":"zh"},"5373":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#开发期诊断","content":"开发期诊断","locale":"zh"},"5374":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","content":"Travels 的持久化契约有意比 JavaScript 的对象模型更小。它不仅适用于当前状态，也适用于旧补丁中保留的值、补丁路径以及自定义历史元数据，而不只是传给 `createTravels()` 的那个对象。","locale":"zh"},"5375":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#推荐的持久化数据","content":"使用普通对象、稠密数组、字符串、除 `-0` 之外的有限数字、布尔值与 `null`。补丁路径必须是 Travels 可接受的 JSON Pointer 字符串，或由字符串与有限非负整数索引组成的稠密数组。","locale":"zh"},"5376":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#推荐的持久化数据","content":"持久化容器应当具有普通的可写、可枚举数据属性以及标准原型。避免访问器、隐藏属性、自定义自有属性、不可扩展容器、数组空洞与内置子类。启用 `enableAutoFreeze` 时，标准冻结容器可以被识别，但对于调用方创建的输入，它们并不是通用的持久化数据建议。","locale":"zh"},"5377":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值    | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议  |\n| ---- | ----- | -------- | --- |\n| 普通对象 | 支持    | 支持       | 首选  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5378":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值    | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议  |\n| ---- | ----- | -------- | --- |\n| 稠密数组 | 支持    | 支持       | 首选  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5379":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值           | 运行时行为        | JSON 持久化 | 建议          |\n| ----------- | ------------ | -------- | ----------- |\n| 稀疏、扩展或子类化数组 | 受持久化校验限制或被拒绝 | 形状无法保留   | 规范化为稠密的普通数组 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5380":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值              | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议  |\n| -------------- | ----- | -------- | --- |\n| 字符串、布尔值、`null` | 支持    | 支持       | 首选  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5381":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值              | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议  |\n| -------------- | ----- | -------- | --- |\n| 除 `-0` 之外的有限数字 | 支持    | 支持       | 首选  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5382":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值              | 运行时行为    | JSON 持久化         | 建议   |\n| -------------- | -------- | ---------------- | ---- |\n| `NaN`、无穷大、`-0` | 部分内存路径支持 | 会变成 `null` 或 `0` | 先规范化 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5383":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值        | 运行时行为    | JSON 持久化               | 建议     |\n| -------- | -------- | ---------------------- | ------ |\n| `bigint` | 部分内存路径支持 | `JSON.stringify()` 会抛错 | 编码为字符串 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5384":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值           | 运行时行为    | JSON 持久化       | 建议        |\n| ----------- | -------- | -------------- | --------- |\n| `undefined` | 可在内存中打补丁 | 对象中会被移除；数组语义不同 | 使用 `null` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5385":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值      | 运行时行为    | JSON 持久化      | 建议            |\n| ------ | -------- | ------------- | ------------- |\n| `Date` | 可克隆，但不持久 | 经 JSON 后变成字符串 | 存时间戳或 ISO 字符串 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5386":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值             | 运行时行为       | JSON 持久化 | 建议        |\n| ------------- | ----------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `Map` / `Set` | 两种运行时模式都会拒绝 | 快照边界会拒绝  | 使用记录或稠密数组 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5387":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值               | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议        |\n| --------------- | ----- | -------- | --------- |\n| 类实例或自定义/null 原型 | 不持久   | 原型与方法会丢失 | 存普通数据或 ID |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5388":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值          | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议        |\n| ---------- | ----- | -------- | --------- |\n| 函数或 symbol | 不持久   | JSON 会丢弃 | 把行为留在状态之外 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5389":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值           | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化         | 建议      |\n| ----------- | ----- | ---------------- | ------- |\n| 循环引用或共享引用身份 | 不持久   | 循环引用会失败；共享引用会被复制 | 规范化为 ID |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5390":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值                        | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议            |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | -------- | ------------- |\n| DOM 节点、ref、observable 实体 | 不持久   | 无法序列化    | 放在 Travels 之外 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5391":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"| 值                     | 运行时行为 | JSON 持久化 | 建议            |\n| --------------------- | ----- | -------- | ------------- |\n| `WeakMap` / `WeakSet` | 不支持   | 无法序列化    | 放在 Travels 之外 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5392":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#兼容性矩阵","content":"原始类型根也可以使用，但可变模式无法原地修改原始值，会回退为不可变替换。如果根身份稳定性很重要，请把原始值包在对象里。","locale":"zh"},"5393":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#在边界处规范化集合","content":"把应用领域中的 Map、Set、Date 或类视图留在 Travels 之外，并从规范化后的状态推导它们。转换之后，不要重放旧的、针对特定集合的补丁历史；请重建权威的当前状态，规范化它，然后开始新的基线。","locale":"zh"},"5394":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#不安全的路径键","content":"Mutative 不会重放 `__proto__` 键下的更改，也不会重放存储在 `constructor` 键下的值内部的更改。Travels 会用 `UNSUPPORTED_STATE` 拒绝这类更新。记录历史之前，请先重命名这些键。根替换在可变模式与受控导航路径中有特殊处理；在实现原地补丁应用之前，请先阅读相关指南。","locale":"zh"},"5395":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#用-createpatchabletravels-强制持久化形状","content":"`PatchableInput<T>` 会执行有限深度的、尽力而为的静态检查。TypeScript 无法证明每一个运行时属性：`number` 仍然包含 `NaN`、无穷大与 `-0`，宽泛的对象类型也会隐藏其内容。因此，严格工厂还会校验具体的初始值。","locale":"zh"},"5396":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#直接检查一个值","content":"问题代码可以识别循环/共享引用、日期、函数、类实例、DOM 节点、Map/Set、bigint、非 JSON 数字、非标准数组/对象形状、弱集合、symbol 与 `undefined` 值。","locale":"zh"},"5397":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#在序列化之前或期间校验","content":"`assertPersistenceCompatible()` 会检查当前状态、保留的补丁值与路径，以及元数据。`serialize({ strict: true })` 会拒绝任何无法通过文档化 JSON 契约往返的值。普通的 `serialize()` 仍然返回脱离原对象的数据，但它不会替你规范化仅存在于运行时的值。","locale":"zh"},"5398":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#开发期诊断","content":"开发构建会扫描初始状态、变更后的状态，以及保留的补丁与元数据，以发现已知风险。`warnOnUnsupportedState: false` 控制这些警告；它既不会启用 Map/Set，也不会让无效持久化变得安全。`onWarning` 会收到结构化的警告代码，`onObserverError` 则隔离诊断或通知钩子抛出的失败。","locale":"zh"},"5399":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-requirements#开发期诊断","content":"生产包默认入口不会包含完整的开发扫描器。严格序列化、恢复校验、受控补丁校验与 Map/Set 拒绝等正确性边界仍然显式存在，而不是依赖控制台警告。","locale":"zh"},"5400":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"page","content":"选择合适的方案","breadcrumbs":["Travels","开始使用"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","locale":"zh"},"5401":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","content":"理解何时基于补丁的历史记录比快照、CRDT 或简单的撤销栈更合适。","locale":"zh"},"5402":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"按工作负载选择","locale":"zh"},"5403":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"比较成本","locale":"zh"},"5404":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#选择所有权模型","content":"选择所有权模型","locale":"zh"},"5405":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtravels","content":"`createTravels()`","locale":"zh"},"5406":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"`createTravelJournal()`","locale":"zh"},"5407":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#选择归档模式","content":"选择归档模式","locale":"zh"},"5408":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"实用决策清单","locale":"zh"},"5409":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","content":"Travels 围绕一个明确的取舍而设计：把一部分计算花在生成与应用补丁上，以缩小保留历史、让完整时间线的持久化变得可行。它并不打算在每一项更新延迟基准上都胜出。","locale":"zh"},"5410":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景           | 推荐方案                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- |\n| 状态很大，编辑只涉及局部 | Travels：保留补丁通常可以避免反复复制完整状态 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5411":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景                | 推荐方案                      |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 历史很长，并且必须在刷新后依然存在 | Travels：一个带版本的快照同时包含状态与历史 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5412":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景               | 推荐方案                    |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 需要可重放的操作日志或撤销元数据 | Travels：条目包含正向/反向补丁与元数据 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5413":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景            | 推荐方案                            |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 状态很小，只需几条本地历史 | 快照栈、Redux-undo 或 Zundo 可能更简单也更快 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5414":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景               | 推荐方案                |\n| ---------------- | ------------------- |\n| 每次编辑都会替换大部分或全部状态 | 两种方案都测一测；补丁成本可能接近快照 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5415":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#按工作负载选择","content":"| 场景              | 推荐方案                            |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 需要多人协作合并与并发冲突消解 | 使用 CRDT/OT 系统；Travels 本身不负责消解冲突 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5416":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"快照历史会为每个条目支付一次状态复制成本，导航通常很便宜。补丁历史需要支付生成与应用补丁的成本，但对于局部更新，它只保留发生变化的操作。","locale":"zh"},"5417":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"在 Travels 中，不可变更新还会借助 Mutative 的结构共享。“基于补丁”并不意味着每个保留状态都被深拷贝，“更小的历史”也不代表 `setState()` 的延迟一定最低。","locale":"zh"},"5418":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"请围绕四个维度测量你的真实工作负载：","locale":"zh"},"5419":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"更新延迟与吞吐量。","locale":"zh"},"5420":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"撤销/重做与事务的延迟。","locale":"zh"},"5421":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"保留及序列化后的历史体积。","locale":"zh"},"5422":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"保存、恢复与语义校验的成本。","locale":"zh"},"5423":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#比较成本","content":"仓库中的基准测试套件把这些关注点分开测量，而不是给出一个放之四海皆准的赢家。","locale":"zh"},"5424":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtravels","content":"当 Travels 应当接收并提交更新时使用它。这是原生状态、reducer 风格状态以及大多数新集成的默认选择。","locale":"zh"},"5425":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtravels","content":"不可变模式返回新的状态引用。","locale":"zh"},"5426":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtravels","content":"可变模式直接更新活动对象，适用于 MobX、Vue、Pinia 等响应式所有者。","locale":"zh"},"5427":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtravels","content":"可以使用 `setState()`、事务、跟踪控制与 `getControls()`。","locale":"zh"},"5428":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"当另一个运行时已经能生成 `nextState`、`patches` 与 `inversePatches` 时使用它。外部所有者仍然是权威来源。","locale":"zh"},"5429":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"用 `recordPatches()` 记录一次已有的提交。","locale":"zh"},"5430":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"通过必需的同步 `apply` 回调执行撤销/重做。","locale":"zh"},"5431":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"避免重复生成同一组补丁。","locale":"zh"},"5432":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"不要把委托的导航结果再次传回 `recordPatches()`。","locale":"zh"},"5433":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#createtraveljournal","content":"提交与失败边界见Journal 指南。","locale":"zh"},"5434":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#选择归档模式","content":"**自动（`autoArchive: true`）**：每次有效的 `setState()` 调用都是一个撤销步骤。这是默认值，也是大多数应用的合适起点。","locale":"zh"},"5435":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#选择归档模式","content":"**手动（`autoArchive: false`）**：更新会立即影响当前状态，而 `archive()` 把待处理的工作合并为一个条目。适用于输入框失焦提交、拖拽手势或应用自定义的事务边界。","locale":"zh"},"5436":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#选择归档模式","content":"如果一次原子操作只需要向观察者发布一个最终事件，优先使用 `transaction()`，而不是手动协调归档。","locale":"zh"},"5437":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"如果以下大多数问题的答案都是“是”，Travels 很可能适合你：","locale":"zh"},"5438":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"撤销/重做是产品功能，而不只是调试便利？","locale":"zh"},"5439":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"更新通常小于完整状态？","locale":"zh"},"5440":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"历史需要元数据、持久化或重放？","locale":"zh"},"5441":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"带版本的快照能简化本地优先存储？","locale":"zh"},"5442":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"你同时需要不可变集成与引用稳定的响应式集成？","locale":"zh"},"5443":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/choosing-travels#实用决策清单","content":"如果你的唯一需求只是在一个组件里保留五步计数器历史，那么一个小的本地栈大概就够了。","locale":"zh"},"5444":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"page","content":"安装","breadcrumbs":["Travels","开始使用"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","locale":"zh"},"5445":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","content":"在 TypeScript 或 JavaScript 应用中安装 Travels 3 与 Mutative 2。","locale":"zh"},"5446":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"环境要求","locale":"zh"},"5447":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#安装依赖","content":"安装依赖","locale":"zh"},"5448":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#验证安装","content":"验证安装","locale":"zh"},"5449":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#可选的官方绑定","content":"可选的官方绑定","locale":"zh"},"5450":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#浏览器打包说明","content":"浏览器打包说明","locale":"zh"},"5451":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh"},"5452":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"服务端使用与仓库工具链需要 **Node.js 22 或更高版本**。","locale":"zh"},"5453":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"浏览器应用需要支持标准 JavaScript 与 JSON API 的**现代浏览器**。","locale":"zh"},"5454":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"**Mutative 2** 是 Travels 的 peer dependency。","locale":"zh"},"5455":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"需要能够定义 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 的打包器；如果要在不使用打包器的情况下加载 ES 模块，请显式使用 Mutative 的生产版浏览器构建。","locale":"zh"},"5456":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#环境要求","content":"Travels 提供 ESM、CommonJS、UMD 与 TypeScript 声明文件。运行时支持策略见兼容性。","locale":"zh"},"5457":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#安装依赖","content":"请安装相互匹配的主版本：`travels@3` 需要 `mutative@^2.0.0`，不支持 Mutative 1。","locale":"zh"},"5458":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-starte