e":"zh"},"5464":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#浏览器打包说明","content":"普通对象、稠密数组、字符串、除 `-0` 之外的有限数字、布尔值与 `null` 共同构成持久化状态契约。Map 与 Set 会被拒绝。持久化之前，请先规范化日期、类实例、非 JSON 数字、函数、ref 以及其他仅存在于运行时的值。参见状态要求。","locale":"zh"},"5465":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation#下一步","content":"跟随快速开始，为时间线加入订阅、元数据、撤销/重做控件与持久化。","locale":"zh"},"5466":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"page","content":"快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Travels","开始使用"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","locale":"zh"},"5467":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","content":"创建时间线、记录编辑、浏览历史，并恢复快照。","locale":"zh"},"5468":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#1-创建时间线","content":"1. 创建时间线","locale":"zh"},"5469":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#2-记录一次编辑","content":"2. 记录一次编辑","locale":"zh"},"5470":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#3-观察已提交的变更","content":"3. 观察已提交的变更","locale":"zh"},"5471":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#4-加入撤销重做与导航","content":"4. 加入撤销、重做与导航","locale":"zh"},"5472":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-5","page_id":"