zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项                       | 类型        | 默认值           | 用途                    |\n| ------------------------ | --------- | ------------- | --------------------- |\n| `warnOnUnsupportedState` | `boolean` | 开发环境中为 `true` | 为状态、补丁、路径与元数据启用兼容性诊断。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6355":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项               | 类型              | 默认值  | 用途                                  |\n| ---------------- | --------------- | ---- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `patchesOptions` | `PatchesOption` | `{}` | 自定义补丁的表示形式，包括 `pathAsArray`；补丁无法禁用。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6356":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项                 | 类型        | 默认值     | 用途                                |\n| ------------------ | --------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `enableAutoFreeze` | `boolean` | `false` | 冻结生成的不可变状态；与 `mutable: true` 不兼容。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6357":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项       | 类型                   | 默认值     | 用途                         |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `strict` | Mutative `strict` 选项 | `false` | 与 Mutative 更严格的不可变性行为保持一致。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6358":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项     | 类型                 | 默认值          | 用途                           |\n| ------ | ------------------ | ------------ | ------------------------