,"6364":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项                | 传入参数                | 运行时机                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `onObserverError` | `{ source, error }` | 监听器或生命周期/诊断钩子在提交后抛出异常时。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6365":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"观察者错误不会回滚已提交的转换。钩子函数不应同步修改同一条时间线。","locale":"zh"},"6366":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"`restoreTravels(snapshot, options?)` 接受适用的创建选项，但有意不接受单独的 `initialState` 或 `history`；完整快照才是原子的状态/历史记录输入。","locale":"zh"},"6367":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"对于可变模式集成，它还接受：","locale":"zh"},"6368":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"`target` 必须是兼容的对象或数组根，并且要求 `mutable: true`。Travels 会用分离的快照状态就地覆盖它。`restoreTravelJournal(snapshot, { apply, ...options })` 则要求外部所有者提供同步的导航回调，并且不暴露与拥有状态相关的可变选项。","locale":"zh"},"6369":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#序列化选项","content":"`strict` 会拒绝任何无法通过文档中定义的 JSON 持久化契约往返的当前状态、保留的补丁值/路径或元数据。如果只想校验而不创建快照，可使用 `assertPersistenceCompatible()`。","locale":"zh"},"6370":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项           | 用途                                           |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------