绑定发布打标签。","locale":"zh"},"6473":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"推送 `main`，然后创建并推送匹配的发布标签：","locale":"zh"},"6474":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"标签必须与 `package.json` 中的版本完全一致，并以 `v` 开头。","locale":"zh"},"6475":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"发布任务会自行选择 npm dist-tag：高于已发布 `latest` 的版本会成为 `latest`，预发布版本会成为 `next`，较旧主版本的维护版本会成为 `v<major>-latest`（例如 `v2-latest`），因此它绝不会替换当前主版本。","locale":"zh"},"6476":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"确认由标签触发的发布流程已完成：","locale":"zh"},"6477":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"`Release`","locale":"zh"},"6478":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"`API Docs`，由 `Release` 使用发布标签触发","locale":"zh"},"6479":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"对已发布包做冒烟测试：","locale":"zh"},"6480":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","type":"page","content":"安全策略","breadcrumbs":["Travels","资源"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/security","locale":"zh"},"6481":{"id":"/zh/doc