656,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[931,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[1608,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[3682,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[3933,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[4208,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[4886,"Monotonic token for committed observable timeline transitions."],[1054,"Most-used exports"],[3267,"Move every undoable state write into `setState()`, keep the callback synchronous, and manage external side effects after successful commit or with a separate compensation strategy. Framework observers attached directly to mutable state can also see provisional writes even though Travels observers cannot."],[2438,"Move through history and expose the right read-only capabilities to UI components."],[2068,"Moving back changes the cursor and state; it does not destroy future entries until a new committed edit creates a branch."],[2853,"Multi-device and collaborative editing"],[286,"mutable"],[536,"mutable"],[812,"mutable"],[1506,"mutable"],[3563,"mutable"],[3813,"mutable"],[4089,"mutable"],[4784,"mutable"],[2379,"Mutable Mode"],[2054,"Mutable mode for identity-stable stores"],[2436,"Mutable mode gives Travels the ergonomics of reactive stores without giving up its patch-based history. Enable it when ordinary operations need reference stability, follow the durable-data contract when persisting, and prefer draft mutations. Check the operation table whenever strict root identity matters."],[2395,"Mutable mode makes Travels play nicely with observable state libraries (MobX, Vue's `reactive`, Pinia stores, etc.) that rely on **stable object references** to notify subscribers. Instead of replacing the entire state object on every update, Travels mutates the original object in place while still recording JSON Patches for undo/redo."],[2429,"Mutable mode still generates JSON patches, so you can persist or inspect diffs just like immutable mode."],[2148,"Mutable mode updates a live object for MobX, Vue, Pinia, and similar reactive owners."],[2875,"Mutable navigation can retain writes made before a replay failure. Semantic validation before restore is therefore both a correctness and availability safeguard for unverified histories."],[2677,"Mutable reactive state"],[2539,"Mutable rollback replays inverse patches only for writes made through Travels APIs. Direct writes to the live object are outside the journal and survive rollback:"],[2048,"Mutable timelines can share the live object with history entries, so an old `getHistory()` result can reflect later in-place updates. Detached snapshots are the correct tool when historical values must remain fixed."],[2523,"Mutable-mode boundary"],[1872,"mutable?"],[5150,"mutable?"],[2679,"Mutation and transaction caution"],[3216,"Mutation smoke test"],[6023,"Mutative 2 保留了 Travels 所用的 API，Travels 无需更改任何选项。Mutative 1.x 的补丁无法正确撤销某些更新，例如在一次草稿更新中先缩短又加长的数组，撤销后会留下空洞；又如元素从 `0` 变为 `-0`，撤销后仍为 `-0`。Mutative 2 能记录这两种情况。"],[6027,"Mutative 2 的补丁直接以“下一状态”中的对象作为值，而不再存深拷贝。因此在不可变模式下，从 `getState()` 读到的对象同时也是已保留历史的一部分，在 Travels 之外修改它会改变重做时重放的内容。请把状态视为只读，或启用 `enableAutoFreeze` 让这类修改抛出错误。可变模式不受影响，因为它存储的是与状态解耦的补丁值。"],[6025,"Mutative 2 的构建目标为 ES2018。对于支持 `Proxy` 但不支持 ES2018 语法的引擎，需要转译 `mutative`。"],[6277,"Mutative 2 的构建以 ES2018 为目标，并通过 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 选择开发版或生产版构建。会定义 `NODE_ENV` 的打包器能同时处理两种构建。不使用打包器时，请加载 `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs` 或 Mutative 的 UMD 构建，因为 Mutative 默认的 ES 模块需要 `process` 全局变量。"],[5463,"Mutative 2 以 ES2018 为目标，并通过 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 选择开发版或生产版代码。Vite、webpack 以及类似的打包器通常会处理这一点。如果不用打包器，请使用 `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs` 或 Mutative 的 UMD 构建，以免浏览器需要 `process` 全局变量。"],[2999,"Mutative 2 builds target ES2018 and read `process.env.NODE_ENV` to select their development or production build. Bundlers that define `NODE_ENV` handle both. Without a bundler, load `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs` or Mutative's UMD build, because Mutative's default ES module needs a `process` global."],[2747,"Mutative 2 builds target ES2018. Transpile `mutative` for engines that support `Proxy` but not ES2018 syntax."],[2745,"Mutative 2 keeps the API that Travels uses, and Travels needs no option changes. Mutative 1.x patches could not undo some updates correctly, such as an array shortened and lengthened again in one recipe, which undo restored with holes, or an element changed from `0` to `-0`, which undo left as `-0`. Mutative 2 records both."],[2749,"Mutative 2 patches hold the objects of the next state as their values instead of deep copies. In immutable mode, an object read from `getState()` is therefore also part of the retained history, and mutating it outside Travels rewrites what redo replays. Treat state as read-only, or enable `enableAutoFreeze` to make such mutations throw. Mutable mode is unaffected, because it stores detached patch values."],[2185,"Mutative 2 targets ES2018 and selects development or production code through `process.env.NODE_ENV`. Vite, webpack, and comparable bundlers normally handle this. Without a bundler, use `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs` or Mutative’s UMD build so the browser does not need a `process` global."],[5394,"Mutative 不会重放 `__proto__` 键下的更改，也不会重放存储在 `constructor` 键下的值内部的更改。Travels 会用 `UNSUPPORTED_STATE` 拒绝这类更新。记录历史之前，请先重命名这些键。根替换在可变模式与受控导航路径中有特殊处理；在实现原地补丁应用之前，请先阅读相关指南。"],[6028,"Mutative 的生产版构建抛出的是 `Minified Mutative error #<code>`，而不是完整错误信息。在生产环境中请匹配错误码，而非错误文本。"],[5831,"Mutative 默认会把草稿函数的修改转换为不可变结果，并把正向和反向补丁交给 Travels。草稿修改通常能产生最精确的操作，并在可变模式下保留原地修改行为。"],[6026,"Mutative 通过读取 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 来选择开发版或生产版构建。请在每个 bundle 中都定义该变量，包括面向 Node.js 的 bundle。若要在不使用打包器的情况下加载 ES 模块，请把 `mutative` 映射到 `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs`，或用 Travels 的 UMD 构建搭配 Mutative 的 UMD 构建。"],[1777,"Mutative options used while semantically replaying every history entry.\nSupply the same strict/mark settings that were used to record the history."],[5055,"Mutative options used while semantically replaying every history entry.\nSupply the same strict/mark settings that were used to record the history."],[2748,"Mutative reads `process.env.NODE_ENV` to select its development or production build. Define it in every bundle, including bundles that target Node.js. To load ES modules without a bundler, map `mutative` to `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs`, or load its UMD build with Travels' UMD build."],[2553,"Mutative turns the recipe into an immutable result by default and gives Travels the forward/inverse patches. Draft mutation usually produces the most precise operations and preserves in-place behavior in mutable mode."],[2116,"Mutative will not replay a change under a `__proto__` key or inside a value stored at a `constructor` key. Travels rejects such updates with `UNSUPPORTED_STATE`. Rename those keys before recording history. Root replacement has special handling in mutable and controlled-navigation paths; see the relevant guides before implementing in-place patch application."],[18,"name"],[104,"name"],[192,"name"],[3295,"name"],[3381,"name"],[3469,"name"],[2807,"Namespace keys by application and document, for example `travels:editor:<documentId>`."],[2441,"Narrow controls for components"],[3016,"Navigation"],[2437,"Navigation and Controls"],[2281,"Navigation and reset contract"],[2710,"Navigation archives pending work in one event"],[2404,"Navigation commands (`back`, `forward`, `go`) reuse the stored patches. `reset()` instead computes a fresh diff back to that baseline copy so it can restore the original data without replaying every history step."],[2254,"Navigation implicitly archives pending work"],[3040,"Navigation publishes `go`. Manual pending work is archived as part of successful navigation. Controlled journals delegate patch application through `apply` and must not record that navigation again as a new external 